zh-Hant"],[["很不錯的拉麵店！\n可能個人口味偏清淡 正常對我來說有點鹹\n（覺得太鹹可以和老闆說 可以調整\n第一次吃覺得湯有點豬腥味 之後都沒有這個問題了～ 剝皮香麻比第一次吃到的還香辣！很好吃 溏心蛋比較沒有味道 有時候會過熟TT\n配料每次好像都會有小小的不同～\n是隔一陣子會想吃一下的拉麵！\n學生點清湯拉麵可以減20\n下午四五點沒什麼人 坐在裡面很自在\n——更——\n來吃過十幾次了 越來越好吃！很喜歡鴨湯底 鴨肉很好吃而且很多TT 老闆會把鴨肉撕成碎肉 沒吃到骨頭過 之後帶家人來吃 其中一位家人也最喜歡鴨肉！是日常的拉麵 沒有太大的驚艷 但日常的溫暖與氣味總是讓人想一直光顧！（目前只點過清湯）",null,[0,45]]]],[null,1761559510000000,1761559510000000,"10 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfRzRubFJTZnlMUXBrMndZZW1pajZhdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfRzRubFJTZnlMUXBrMndZZW1pajZhdxoTQ2d3STFvZjl4d1lReUxXcm13SQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjZ2NXIwNKWAxWzdvUHHQ5gGCcQ_2MIVigI"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17456494636372075414/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM0ZW1WSVpHOVhXRTB6Wld4a01WVnJlSHBhUjBVMVpXNU5NRmxyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17456494636372075414/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM0ZW1WSVpHOVhXRTB6Wld4a01WVnJlSHBhUjBVMVpXNU5NRmxyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17456494636372075414/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM0ZW1WSVpHOVhXRTB6Wld4a01WVnJlSHBhUjBVMVpXNU5NRmxyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17456494636372075414/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM0ZW1WSVpHOVhXRTB6Wld4a01WVnJlSHBhUjBVMVpXNU5NRmxyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17456494636372075414/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM0ZW1WSVpHOVhXRTB6Wld4a01WVnJlSHBhUjBVMVpXNU5NRmxyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17456494636372075414/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnM0ZW1WSVpHOVhXRTB6Wld4a01WVnJlSHBhUjBVMVpXNU5NRmxyUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝評論回饋，清湯的部分每次都會調整一下骨頭比例，那天應該是吃到豬骨比較多的那鍋😅我們再盡量注意，也恭喜找到喜歡的口味👍",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,8483,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m